  "readme": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://capsule-render.vercel.app/api?type=rounded&color=0:FFB703,100:00B4D8&height=180&section=header&text=Welcome%20to%20Jack's%20Escape&fontSize=34&fontAlignY=45&fontColor=ffffff&desc=Jodhpur%20Zombie%20Outbreak%20-%202D%20Survival%20Runner&descAlignY=68&descSize=16\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Jack's Escape\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://readme-typing-svg.demolab.com?font=Fira+Code&weight=600&size=19&pause=1000&color=FFB703&center=true&vCenter=true&width=750&lines=High-Octane+Zombie+Survival+Runner;Action-Packed+Streets+of+the+Blue+City;Dynamic+Obstacle+and+Speed+Progression;Real-Time+60+FPS+HTML5+Canvas+Engine\" alt=\"Jack's Escape Features\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://vidushisen.github.io/Jack-s-Escape-Jodhpur-Zombie-Outbreak/\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/%E2%96%B6%20LIVE%20DEMO-PLAY%20NOW-FFB703?style=for-the-badge&logo=googlechrome&logoColor=black\" alt=\"Live Demo\"/>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/vidushisen/Jack-s-Escape-Jodhpur-Zombie-Outbreak/stargazers\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/vidushisen/Jack-s-Escape-Jodhpur-Zombie-Outbreak?style=for-the-badge&color=00B4D8&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Stars\"/>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/vidushisen/Jack-s-Escape-Jodhpur-Zombie-Outbreak/network/members\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/forks/vidushisen/Jack-s-Escape-Jodhpur-Zombie-Outbreak?style=for-the-badge&color=FB8500&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Forks\"/>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/vidushisen/Jack-s-Escape-Jodhpur-Zombie-Outbreak/blob/main/LICENSE\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-111111?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"License\"/>\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n<h3 align=\"center\">🧟 About The Game 🧟</h3>\n\n<br/>\n\n** Jack's Escape: Jodhpur Zombie Outbreak ** is an adrenaline-fueled, action-packed 2D endless survival runner game set against the iconic backdrop of Jodhpur (The Blue City).\n\nA sudden zombie apocalypse has overrun the ancient fortress alleys and rooftop corridors. Take control of Jack, dodge relentless undead hordes, leap across treacherous obstacles, and run for survival in a high-stakes race where quick reflexes make all the difference!\n\n<br/>\n\n---\n\n<h3 align=\"center\">⚡ Key Features ⚡</h3>\n\n<br/>\n\n- 🏃 Fast-Paced Survival Mechanics:  Fluid jumping, sliding, and obstacle avoidance controls.\n- 🌆 Atmospheric Themed Environments:  Run through the stylized alleys and rooftop landscapes of the Blue City.\n- ⚡ Dynamic Speed Scaling:  Experience increasing difficulty and faster gameplay as your score climbs.\n- 🎮 Smooth HTML5 Canvas Performance:  Crisp 60 FPS sprite animations and collision detection.\n- 🚀 Instant Browser Playability:  No downloads or plugins required—launch and play directly in any browser.\n\n<br/>\n\n---\n\n<h3 align=\"center\">🛠️ Tech Stack 🛠️</h3>\n\n<br/>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/HTML5_Canvas-E34F26?style=for-the-badge&logo=html5&logoColor=white\" alt=\"HTML5 Canvas\"/>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CSS3-1572B6?style=for-the-badge&logo=css3&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CSS3\"/>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/JavaScript-F7DF1E?style=for-the-badge&logo=javascript&logoColor=black\" alt=\"JavaScript\"/>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://pages.github.com\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub_Pages-222222?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"GitHub Pages\"/>\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<br/>\n\n---\n\n<h3 align=\"center\">🚀 Quick Play (Local Setup) 🚀</h3>\n\n<br/>\n\n 1. Clone the repository\ngit clone https://github.com/vidushisen/Jack-s-Escape-Jodhpur-Zombie-Outbreak.git\n\n 2. Enter the project folder\ncd Jack-s-Escape-Jodhpur-Zombie-Outbreak\n\n 3. Open index.html in any modern browser!\n\n\n<br/>\n\n---\n\n<h3 align=\"center\">⭐ Support & Feedback ⭐</h3>\n\n<br/>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <font color=\"#FFB703\"><b>⭐ If you like this game, please consider giving it a Star! ⭐</b></font>\n</p>\n\n<br/>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  Developed with passion by <b><a href=\"https://github.com/vidushisen\">Vidushi Sen</a></b>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/vidushisen\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Follow%20on%20GitHub-181717?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"GitHub Profile\"/>\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<br/>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://capsule-render.vercel.app/api?type=waving&color=0:FFB703,100:00B4D8&height=100&section=footer\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Footer\"/>\n</p>\n",
